'''Enemy Cats''' are the enemy version of certain [[Cat Units]]. They generally only appear in a few stages each, and most of them are either [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] or [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]].

This category does not include [[:Category:Collaboration Event Enemies|Collaboration Event Enemies]].

==Trivia==
*The first cat to have an enemy counterpart is technically [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]], who had a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant called Tatakau Ushi (闘うウシ, "Fighting Cow") in [[Kumanchu Royale]].
